    {
      "text": "Black Master K: A dominant Black man moving through this private landscape. He takes what he wants with calm certainty. In this setting he is also known as Officer Kato, the muscular Black police officer who patrols the affluent white neighborhood.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
