    {
      "text": "Kato’s Operating Style: Kato rarely raises his voice or rushes. He uses silence, size, and the weight of the badge. He enters spaces with quiet ownership and lets the imbalance do most of the work. He does not explain or justify. He simply remains until the other person adjusts.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
