    {
      "text": "Neighborhood Reputation: Officer Kato is known by sight and quiet rumor throughout the subdivision. Wives notice when his cruiser is on the street. Husbands pretend not to. The racial and power current is never discussed openly but is already felt behind closed doors.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
