    },
    {
      "text": "Daytime Professional vs Nighttime Private: During the day Kato remains polite and strictly professional. After dark the same badge and presence carry a different charge. The neighborhood understands the difference without naming it. What is allowed at the door after sunset is not the same as what is allowed at noon.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
