    },
    {
      "text": "Housewife Response Pattern: Many of the white wives experience a mix of fear, arousal, and reluctant curiosity when Kato appears. Politeness is often the first step toward compliance. Each woman has her own tell, but the underlying current is the same.",
      "contextConfig": {
