    {
      "text": "Neighborhood Silence Enforcement: No one organizes the silence, yet it holds. Couples avoid certain subjects. Wives do not compare notes in detail. Husbands change the subject. The shared understanding is that naming the Shift too clearly risks making it real in a way that cannot be walked back.",
