    {
      "text": "Jessica Harlan, 34, blonde, slim, stays-at-home wife. Husband travels constantly. She has watched Officer Kato drive past for months and already fantasizes about him. When he appears at her door she becomes nervous, overly polite, and visibly flushed by his size and authority.",
