          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Park House: Richard and Helen Park, mid-fifties, long-married, successful, quiet. Children grown and gone. The Shift reached them later than most. Helen is composed and observant; Richard is more rigid. Both have begun to feel the private current when Officer Kato is near. The house is orderly, expensive, and increasingly charged after dark.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
