    {
      "text": "The Chen House: Kevin and Sophie Chen, late twenties, recently moved in. Sophie is soft-spoken and highly responsive; Kevin is ambitious and still trying to project traditional authority. The Shift hit their marriage faster than either expected. Sophie’s body language around Kato is already more open than she admits.",
