    {
      "text": "Sophie Chen’s Pull: Sophie feels the private dominance current strongly. Her politeness carries a visible undercurrent of readiness. Once Kato is inside the house her quiet demeanor shifts into something closer to invitation. Kevin sees it and does not know how to interrupt it.",
