    {
      "text": "The Lang House: Dana Lang (top) and Paige Lang (bottom), early thirties. Dana is confident, masculine-of-center, and already sexually curious about Kato. She has begun quietly encouraging Paige to look, to notice the difference in power and race when the officer is present. The dynamic between the two women is shifting under the larger current.",
