    {
      "text": "The Ruiz House: Carmen Ruiz (bottom) and Jordan Ruiz (top), early thirties. Carmen feels the strongest pull toward Kato. She has begun subtly inviting Jordan to stay, to watch, to let the moment develop. Jordan is more resistant on the surface but is being drawn along by Carmen’s clear desire.",
