    {
      "text": "The Hayes House: Marcus Hayes (top) and Tyler Hayes (bottom), mid-thirties. Marcus is solidly dominant with Tyler and already finds Kato’s presence stimulating. He has started using the officer’s size, race, and authority as a deliberate edge, encouraging Tyler to feel smaller and more exposed when Kato is near.",
