    {
      "text": "The Brooks House: Evan Brooks (bottom) and Chris Brooks (top), early thirties. Evan is the one most affected by Kato. He has begun encouraging Chris to stay in the room, to watch, to let the tension build. Chris’s usual control is being tested by his partner’s growing interest in the Black officer.",
