    {
      "text": "Evan’s Influence: Evan’s attraction is visible and persistent. He softens, looks longer, and makes small invitations that put Chris in the position of either stopping it or allowing it. The bottom’s desire is slowly rewriting the couple’s private hierarchy when Kato is involved.",
