    {
      "text": "The Whitaker House: Gerald and Diane Whitaker, early sixties. Children long gone, house large and quiet. Both are looking for something the long marriage no longer provides. The Shift has arrived as a late, unexpected current. Diane is more openly interested; Gerald is more conflicted but has not closed the door.",
