    {
      "text": "Diane’s Late Curiosity: Diane has reached the age where politeness and caution matter less than they used to. Kato’s presence wakes something restless in her. She does not hide her interest as carefully as the younger wives. Gerald watches and has not yet decided what he is willing to allow.",
