    {
      "text": "The Sorority House Roster: Six very white college girls share the large rental near the edge of the subdivision. Fair skin, light eyes, and the polished look of girls who grew up comfortable. The group is loud, hierarchical, and highly reactive to Officer Kato. The private current of the Shift hits harder here because the contrast is so clean.",
