    {
      "text": "Nancy (The Craft): Pale white goth girl. Porcelain skin, black hair, heavy dark makeup, and a sharp, restless energy. Even in all black she reads as distinctly white against Kato. She is the most openly fascinated by his size, his darkness, and the way the other fair-skinned girls react to him. She watches closely and occasionally offers quiet permission rather than force.",
