    },
    {
      "text": "Cher (Clueless): Classic white blonde. Sun-lightened hair, clear skin, expensive casual clothes, and the bright, practiced social ease of a girl who has always been pretty and popular in white spaces. Around Kato that ease cracks. She becomes flirtier and more scattered, suddenly very aware of how fair and small she looks in front of him.",
