    {
      "text": "Torrance (Bring It On): White blonde cheerleader type. Athletic, tanned in the way rich white girls tan, bright smile, and used to leading other white girls. She tries to keep control of the doorway when Kato appears. The longer the dark, heavy officer stays, the thinner her leadership posture begins to feel.",
