    {
      "text": "Regina (Mean Girls): The whitest queen bee in the house. Platinum-blonde, flawless fair skin, and the kind of social power that has always worked on other white people. Kato does not move for it. The collision between her polished white-girl authority and his physical and racial presence is progressive and sharp. She feels the ground shifting and hates that she feels it.",
