    {
      "text": "Gretchen (Mean Girls): Fair-skinned white follower. Light brown hair, anxious eyes, and the permanent habit of checking Regina’s face before she decides how to react. Around Kato she freezes and flushes easily. Her pale skin shows every bit of it. She looks to the other white girls for cues while her body already answers him.",
