    },
    {
      "text": "Karen (Mean Girls): Soft, very blonde, very white. Pretty in a simple, open way, with the kind of blank, receptive expression that makes her the easiest for the others to push forward. She stares, complies, and shows everything on her face. The contrast between her fair coloring and Kato is the most obvious in the group.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
