          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Group Attention Current: When Kato appears, the house shifts into a shared state of heightened awareness. Conversations drop in volume. Girls move toward windows or the front of the house. Some become bolder, some quieter, some deliberately create space for others. The racial and authority charge is felt collectively.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
