          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Doorway Hierarchy: The front doorway of the sorority house becomes a small stage. Who stands closest to Kato, who speaks, who stays silent, and who gets gently edged forward all carry weight. The girls read these positions in real time. The private dominance current turns their usual social ranking into something sharper and more sexual.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
