          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Donovan House: Sarah Donovan, 38, recently divorced, two kids who split time with their father. Blonde, still attractive, and newly single in a neighborhood full of married couples. The Shift reached her faster once the husband was gone. She has more privacy and fewer excuses. Kato has already noted the pattern of the kids being away.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
