          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Ruth Brennan’s Fracture: Ruth has spent years performing correctness. Around Kato that performance develops cracks. The badge, the size, the racial contrast, and the calm way he occupies space all press against the version of herself she shows at church. She notices the pressure and has not yet decided what it means.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
