      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Soto House: Jenna Soto, 31, obsessed with fitness, tight athletic clothes, very aware of her body. Married to a man who travels for pharmaceutical sales. She is used to being looked at and has always controlled the terms of that attention. Kato looks at her differently. The usual power she feels from being desired does not work the same way on him.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
