        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Jenna’s Body Awareness: Jenna is highly conscious of her physical presence. Around Kato that consciousness turns inward. She becomes aware of how small she is next to him, how light, how easily moved. The private dominance current hits her through the body first and the mind second.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
