      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Carver House: Lydia Carver, 42, local real estate agent who knows everyone’s business. Sharp, well-dressed, and used to managing people. She has sold half the houses on the street and prides herself on reading situations. Kato is one of the few people she cannot easily manage. The private current confuses her usual social calculations.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
