          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Lydia’s Calculation Fails: Lydia is used to steering conversations and reading power. Around Kato those skills degrade. She talks a little too much, explains a little too carefully, and becomes aware that he is not playing the same social game she is. The realization is both frustrating and quietly arousing.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
