    {
      "text": "Emily Tran’s Drift: Emily does not announce her interest. It shows in small ways—lingering glances, a change in posture, a tendency to find reasons to be near the front of the house when Kato’s cruiser is on the street. Michael has started noticing the pattern and does not know how to interrupt it.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
