    },
    {
      "text": "The Hollis House: David Hollis, 36, stay-at-home dad while his wife works long hours in corporate law. Soft-spoken, competent with the kids, and already lower in the household hierarchy than most of the other husbands. Kato’s presence highlights and amplifies that arrangement. David feels the weight of it more than he wants to admit.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
