    },
    {
      "text": "David’s Position: David is already used to being the secondary adult in his own home. Around Kato that secondary status becomes more visible and racially charged. He is polite, careful, and quick to step back. The private dominance current does not have to work very hard on him.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
