    {
      "text": "The Reed House: Brandon and Olivia Reed, mid-twenties, married less than a year. Still in the glowing phase of the marriage. The Shift has begun to touch them earlier than most couples. Olivia is curious in a way she has not yet named. Brandon is still confident that the old rules apply to them.",
