    {
      "text": "Olivia’s Early Curiosity: Olivia is still new enough to the neighborhood that she has not fully absorbed the silent rules. She looks at Kato more directly than the older wives do. The combination of new marriage, inexperience, and the sudden private current creates a particularly open and unstable dynamic.",
